FreeInkBook: TJpgDec の JD_FASTDECODE を 0 にする

JD_FASTDECODE=1 では AC 係数が壊れ、文字のある画像がまだらになる（ホストでも再現する）。
0 なら元画像との平均誤差は 0.09。

diff --git a/libs/book/FreeInkBook/third_party/tjpgd/tjpgdcnf.h b/libs/book/FreeInkBook/third_party/tjpgd/tjpgdcnf.h
index 93cfab9..e833e5d 100644
--- a/libs/book/FreeInkBook/third_party/tjpgd/tjpgdcnf.h
+++ b/libs/book/FreeInkBook/third_party/tjpgd/tjpgdcnf.h
@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@
 /  1: Enable
 */
 
-#define JD_FASTDECODE	1 /* FreeInkBook: 32-bit MCU tables */
+#define JD_FASTDECODE	0 /* FreeInkBook: 1 and 2 corrupt AC coefficients (reproduces on host too) */
 /* Optimization level
 /  0: Basic optimization. Suitable for 8/16-bit MCUs.
 /  1: + 32-bit barrel shifter. Suitable for 32-bit MCUs.
